## Fact-Check Notes

- **6 Rs migration framework**: Industry-standard model (rehost, replatform, repurchase, refactor, retain, retire) — widely adopted by AWS, Azure, and GCP partners. ✅ Verified
- **FinOps practices**: FinOps Foundation defines this as the operating model for cloud financial management. ✅ Verified
- **UAE Data Protection Law**: Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021 — effective January 2022. ✅ Verified
- **Saudi PDPL**: Personal Data Protection Law (Royal Decree M/19), effective September 2023. ✅ Verified
- **Terraform/Ansible**: Industry-standard IaC tools, widely adopted. ✅ Verified
- **GitOps with ArgoCD**: CNCF graduated project for declarative Git-based Kubernetes deployment. ✅ Verified


